OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer sacked over online racist
OL,4,Aand sexist remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Derbyshire Police officer has been
OL,7,Fsacked after repeatedly making
OL,8,Foffensive "racist and sexist" comments
OL,9,Fon social media - despite several
OL,10,Fwarnings.
OL,12,FPC Stefan Downs made a number of
OL,13,Fdiscriminatory comments in reference to
OL,14,Fblack people, a misconduct hearing
OL,15,Ffound.
OL,17,FThe hearing's report said one of his
OL,18,Fcomments "condones violence to be used
OL,19,Fagainst a child".
